# Saint Agnes Sanatorium (CIPlay saint_agnes_sanatorium): The Lullaby Frequency's second island, quest "Admitted With the
# Song". The terrace (6 m); the day room x -15..-3 z -6..0 (door x -10.5..-9 on z -6; the piano at -6 -2.2); Ward C
# x 3..12 z -6..0 (its door panel x 6..7.5); the veranda x -15..-3 z -12.5..-9.5; the hydrotherapy house x -5..2.5
# z 6..12 (door x -3.5..-2 on z 6); the gate at 0 -30, the vending machine at 9 -17. DEEP 10-25: Chapel Hill at -40 40
# (foot zone hillfoot at -22.32 22.32), the drowned sea-bathing house at 60 -58 (-14 m), the patients' cave at 20 65.
island Saint Agnes Sanatorium
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Admitted With the Song
wait 3
expect hidden musicbox
walk 0 -40 to 0 -34
zone gate
expect step 1
walk 0 -26 to 0 -8 to -9.75 -8 to -9.75 -4.6 h=6.2
read Admissions book
expect step 2
read Nurse Edda's rota
expect step 3
use piano
expect shown musicbox
expect story pianoplayed 1
use piano
expect message keeps playing by itself
expect step 4
open Music box
expect story wardckey 1
expect step 5
use wardcdoor
expect hidden wardcdoor
walk 6.75 -8 to 6.75 -4 h=6.2
zone ward_c
expect step 6
read Bed 4 chart
read Bed 7 chart
read Bed 7 chart
expect story chart 2
read Bed 9 chart
expect story chart 3
expect step 7
walk 0 -2 to 0 3 to -2.75 4 to -2.75 7.5 h=6.2
zone hydro
expect step 8
expect hidden drainzone
use crank
expect hidden basinwater
expect shown drainzone
expect step 9
zone drain
wait 2
kill Roach
expect step 10
zone hillfoot
expect step 11
zone hilltop
expect step 12
read Chaplain Aldous Penn's sermon notes
expect step 13
open Bell tower box
expect story cabinetkey 1
expect step 14
zone seabath
expect step 15
air bathair
read Bath attendant Mabel Orr's note
expect step 16
zone patientcave
read Orderly Kip Rennie's note
open Orderly's box
expect step 16
open Doctor Vell's cabinet
expect step 17
read Vell - final entry
expect done
storespot 0 -18
